\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Constraint ablation (Qwen2.5-14B, $n = 804$). Agreement: predictions identical to SC. MAX-SAT and count-only produce nearly identical predictions, confirming that self-extracted constraints carry no signal beyond vote counts.}}{16}{table.caption.44}\protected@file@percent }
